Modularized various common blocks
Neoclassical corrections to Zhdanov-Grad closure for impurities
Renamed Eirene interface directory from couple_SOLPS-ITER to couple_SOLPS_WG
Added new PARDISO solver option
Added b2mod_blns which produces the tracing/blnn_SPb.trc file
Added b2mod_convergence for potential equation inner iterations variables
Added b2mod_umfpack as new optional matrix solver
Added b2mod_b2plot_gui, the binary message channel of b2plot to the b2plot.py GUI
Added gui_data.F (b2plot), the GUI data commands guigeom, guifield, guiefld and guivect of b2plot for b2plot.py
Added gui_movies.F (b2plot), the GUI movie commands guimvinf, guimovie and guimvvec of b2plot for b2plot.py
